# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# Timing of a plan's projection (drawing quality plan, item 15;
# ui/panels/bim_plan_projection.dl): generates a tower of at least N walls
# (the first argument, 312 by default) with R rooms a side (the second, 12
# by default: 312 walls a storey), then times, for the ground floor's plan,
# the cut the plan already makes, the projection worked out (below and
# above the cut), and the projection asked for again unchanged (kept).
import ui/panels/bim_plan_projection.dl

function report bim projection step {a string:label} from {a 64 bit integer:started}:
    execute:
        set spent to (the bim microseconds now) - started
        print ((label + (the string form of " ")) + ((the string form of (spent / (1000 as a 64 bit integer))) + (the string form of " ms"))) as a line

set arguments to the command line arguments
set wanted to 312
set roomsASide to 12
if (the length of arguments) > 0:
    set wanted to (@intrinsic("call", "libc", "atoi", integer, the data of (the argument at 0 in arguments)))
if (the length of arguments) > 1:
    set roomsASide to (@intrinsic("call", "libc", "atoi", integer, the data of (the argument at 1 in arguments)))
set editor to a new bim editor
set storeys to add bim generated tower of wanted walls with roomsASide rooms a side to (the address of editor)
set modelValue to editor's documentValue's current
print (((the string form of "walls ") + (the string form of (the length of (modelValue's walls's values)))) + ((the string form of ", openings ") + ((the string form of (the length of (modelValue's openings's values))) + ((the string form of ", slabs ") + ((the string form of (the length of (modelValue's slabs's values))) + ((the string form of ", levels ") + (the string form of (the length of (modelValue's levels's values))))))))) as a line
set started to the bim microseconds now
update bim evaluation (the address of (editor's evaluation)) to editor's documentValue's current
report bim projection step (the string form of "evaluate") from started
set editor's adopted to true
set editor's adoptedMicroseconds to 0 as a 64 bit integer
refresh bim editor (the address of editor)
set planView to add bim view of kind bim plan view named (the string form of "Ground floor") on editor's levelId to (the address of (editor's documentValue's current))
set editor's planViewId to planView
refresh bim editor (the address of editor)
set scene to an empty list of a bim scene mesh record
set started to the bim microseconds now
set recut to the bim view of editor's evaluation cut by (the bim plan plane at (the bim storey elevation of editor) cut at (the bim plan cut height of editor))
report bim projection step ((the string form of "plan cut, polygons ") + (the string form of (the bim polygon count of recut))) from started
set planProjection to an empty bim plan projection
set started to the bim microseconds now
refresh bim plan projection in (the address of planProjection) of editor among scene cut as editor's plan
report bim projection step ((the string form of "projection worked out, below ") + ((the string form of (the length of (planProjection's below's values))) + ((the string form of ", above ") + (the string form of (the length of (planProjection's above's values)))))) from started
set started to the bim microseconds now
refresh bim plan projection in (the address of planProjection) of editor among scene cut as editor's plan
report bim projection step ((the string form of "projection kept, builds ") + (the string form of planProjection's builds)) from started
